# Corpus-pack texts and build output stay local: some editions are under copyright or carry a
# no-repost notice (DECISIONS 33, 35), and this repository is public. The pack contract, the
# manifest and the golden set are tracked. See data/packs/README.md, "Distribution".
data/packs/*/texts/
data/packs/*/build/
